  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "華語教學英文",
    "sub_ename": "ENGLISH FOR TEACHING CHINESE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程針對學生在華語教學裡常用到的英文表達與溝通，提升能力並實務演練。期望學生能熟稔華語教材裡的英語用詞，並能針對華語學習難點以更精確的英文進行分析解說，也可對於華語零起點學習者，或是華語文化課程等所需之英文，分別進行實務演練。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to familiarize students with English expressions frequently used in Chinese teaching, with the goal to improve students’ ability to use English in teaching foreign language learners. Students are expected to readily use English to explain the learning points that prove to be the most difficult parts for learners. Moreover, students get the hand-on practice in using English to teach learners who have no Chinese-learning background or who take interest in learning more about Chinese culture.",
